{
  "uid": "bigdata-infra",
  "title": "🩺 Infraestructura — Big Data local",
  "description": "Dashboard técnico de observabilidad: salud de servicios, CPU, memoria y Kafka.",
  "tags": ["bigdata", "infra", "prometheus"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "liveNow": true,
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "🧭 Cómo leer este dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Observabilidad técnica",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Métricas de infraestructura (Prometheus + cAdvisor + kafka-exporter)\n\n| Tipo de panel | Qué mide | Ejemplo aquí |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Stat con color** | Estado binario (OK / caído) | Servicios monitoreados (verde = up) |\n| **Time series** | Recurso en el tiempo | CPU y memoria por contenedor |\n| **Time series con umbrales** | Métrica con alerta visual | Lag de consumidores Kafka |\n\n> Símil en la nube: Cloud Monitoring (GCP), CloudWatch (AWS), Azure Monitor."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "✅ Salud de servicios (panel Stat)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Prometheus",
      "description": "1 = recolectando métricas, 0 = caído",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "UP" } }, "type": "value" }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"prometheus\"}", "legendFormat": "prometheus", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "cAdvisor",
      "description": "Métricas de contenedores Docker",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "UP" } }, "type": "value" }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"cadvisor\"}", "legendFormat": "cadvisor", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Kafka exporter",
      "description": "Métricas de topics y consumidores",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "UP" } }, "type": "value" }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"kafka\"}", "legendFormat": "kafka", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Contenedores activos",
      "description": "Contenedores bigdata-* corriendo ahora",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 8 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "count(container_last_seen{name=~\"bigdata-.*\"})", "legendFormat": "contenedores", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Mensajes en Kafka (total)",
      "description": "Offset acumulado en todos los topics (sin internos __*)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic!~\"__.*\"})", "legendFormat": "mensajes", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "💻 Recursos por contenedor (panel Time series)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU por contenedor (núcleos)",
      "description": "Uso de CPU. Picos altos en jupyter = Spark procesando streaming.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "núcleos",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max", "last"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\"bigdata-.*\"}[1m])", "legendFormat": "{{name}}", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria por contenedor",
      "description": "RAM usada por cada contenedor del stack.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "memoria",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 25,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" }
          },
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max", "last"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\"bigdata-.*\"}", "legendFormat": "{{name}}", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "📨 Kafka — mensajería en tiempo real",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mensajes acumulados por topic",
      "description": "Cuántos mensajes hay en cada topic. Sube cuando el generador está activo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "gradientMode": "scheme",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["last", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum by (topic) (kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic!~\"__.*\"})", "legendFormat": "{{topic}}", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Velocidad de ingesta (msg/s por topic)",
      "description": "Tasa de mensajes por segundo. Con generador a 5 tx/s deberías ver ~5 msg/s en 'transacciones'.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" }
          },
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max", "last"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(kafka_topic_partition_current_offset{topic!~\"__.*\"}[1m]))", "legendFormat": "{{topic}}", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lag de consumidores Kafka",
      "description": "Mensajes pendientes de leer. Verde = 0 (al día). Amarillo/rojo = Spark no está consumiendo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line+area" }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 200 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["last", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum by (consumergroup, topic) (kafka_consumergroup_lag)", "legendFormat": "{{consumergroup}} / {{topic}}", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
